						<P CLASS="Texttable" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;orphans:1;page-break-after:auto;page-break-before:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:0;widows:1;text-align:right;"><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;color:#d2232a;">PRELIMINARY&#x00a0;</FONT><FONT CLASS="Bold" STYLE="font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;color:#d2232a;">PROSPECTUS&#x00a0;DATED&#x00a0;NOVEMBER&#x00a0;27,&#x00a0;2023</FONT></P>
